ors to continuously monitor your heart rate and blood oxygen level, and automatically monitors your sleep statu", "【1.83 inch HD touch screen and custom dial】This D16 smart watch is equipped with a 1.83-inch TFT-LCD HD full touch screen with a resolution of up to 240*284, which brings you a sensitive touch experie", "【Long battery life and multi-function】The D16 smartwatch is equipped with a 300mAh large capacity battery. It only takes 2 hours of magnetic charging to fully charge the watch. It can be used for 5-7 "]}, "B07WFF17BQ": {"rating": 4.5, "reviews": 54106, "bullets": ["3 Convenient Sizes: the bamboo cutting board set includes 15 x 10 in, 12 x 8 in, and 9 x 6 in boards - perfect for chopping, prepping, or serving a charcuterie board. made from 100% natural bamboo for", "Built-in Side Handles: Our wooden chopping board doubles as a chopping block, serving tray, or cheese platter - built-in side handles make kitchen-to-table transfers effortless and mess-free, pairing ", "Knife-Friendly Surface: These cutting boards for kitchen are gentle on blades to prevent dulling, with a smooth bamboo finish and protective coating that resists scratches, stains, and bacteria.", "Mess-free Cutting and Transfer: Our professional-grade cutting boards feature deep juice grooves to catch liquid from meats and fruits - keeping your counters clean and your workspace organized alongs", "Easy to Clean and Maintain: Quick cleanup after use - simply hand wash with mild soap and warm water. This bamboo serving board’s sealed surface resists staining and odor buildup. Not dishwasher-safe "]}, "B00MVWGQX0": {"rating": 4.4, "reviews": 44591, "bullets": ["DRIP MACHINE EXPERIENCE — The Cuisinart drip coffee maker for households brewing a full pot daily who refuse to settle for lukewarm coffee. Serve guests or enjoy multiple cups yourself.", "HOTTER COFFEE — PerfecTemp technology brews at a higher temperature, and an adjustable warming plate lets you choose Low, Medium, or High to keep coff